      "side": 1,
      "message": "Justin and Jeongik pointed in aosp/2374713 if using minSdkVersion for `target-sdk-version` was intended here. \n\nIs there a reason why we do not use the target_sdk_version in Android.bp as target-sdk-version in aapt2? If there is, I can document it here.",
